[codex] 
[codex] # Verification Loop Skill
[codex] 
[codex] A comprehensive verification system for Claude Code sessions.
[codex] 
[codex] ## When to Use
[codex] 
[codex] Invoke this skill:
[codex] - After completing a feature or significant code change
[codex] - Before creating a PR
[codex] - When you want to ensure quality gates pass
[codex] - After refactoring
[codex] 
[codex] ## Verification Phases
[codex] 
[codex] Choose the commands adaptively for the current project instead of running every example blindly. Use the stack-appropriate command from `references/STACK-DETECTION.md` when the repo does not match the default examples below.
[codex] 
[codex] 
[codex] ### Phase 1: Build Verification
[codex] ```bash
[codex] # Python projects (uv)
[codex] uv build 2>&1 | tail -20
[codex] # OR
[codex] python -m build 2>&1 | tail -20
[codex] 
[codex] # Node.js projects
[codex] npm run build 2>&1 | tail -20
[codex] # OR
[codex] pnpm build 2>&1 | tail -20
[codex] ```
[codex] 
[codex] If build fails, STOP and fix before continuing.
[codex] 
[codex] ### Phase 2: Type Check
[codex] ```bash
[codex] # TypeScript projects
[codex] npx tsc --noEmit 2>&1 | head -30
[codex] 
[codex] # Python projects
[codex] pyright . 2>&1 | head -30
[codex] ```
[codex] 
[codex] Report all type errors. Fix critical ones before continuing.
[codex] 
[codex] ### Phase 3: Lint Check
[codex] ```bash
[codex] # JavaScript/TypeScript
[codex] npm run lint 2>&1 | head -30
[codex] 
[codex] # Python
[codex] ruff check . 2>&1 | head -30
[codex] ```
[codex] 
[codex] ### Phase 4: Test Suite
[codex] ```bash
[codex] # Python projects
[codex] pytest --cov=src --cov-report=term-missing 2>&1 | tail -50
[codex] 
[codex] # Node.js projects
[codex] npm run test -- --coverage 2>&1 | tail -50
[codex] ```
[codex] 
[codex] Report:
[codex] - Total tests: X
[codex] - Passed: X
[codex] - Failed: X
[codex] - Coverage: X%
[codex] 
[codex] ### Phase 5: Security Scan
[codex] ```bash
[codex] # Python: Check for secrets
